Details:
Generate a short 5-10 second vertical video (9:16, social-ready) of chicken and waffles using the Runway skill.
Shot concept: mouth-watering, social-media food video — think Instagram Reels / TikTok food content.
Suggested prompt: cinematic close-up of crispy golden fried chicken being placed on a fluffy waffle, hot honey drizzled slowly over the top in slow motion, steam rising, warm moody kitchen lighting, shallow depth of field, vertical 9:16 format, food photography style, 4K
Specs:
- Format: 9:16 vertical (portrait, 1080x1920)
- Duration: 5-10 seconds
- Quality: social-ready (Instagram Reels / TikTok)
- Use Runway skill at ~/.openclaw/skills/runway/
- API key in ~/.openclaw/workspaces/rolo/.env
Save output to: ~/go/src/github.com/madeinwyo/mission-control/content/assets/video/chicken-and-waffles.mp4
When done, post the video to #general in Discord (channel ID: 1483917792745885768) and report back to Roscoe.

Log your progress at EVERY major step — not just start and done. Required log points:
